   {
    "id": "t1",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 6.8,
    "text": "dad is smoking marijuana regularly bad for your heart well let's all agree on one thing"
   },
   {
    "id": "t2",
    "start": 6.8,
    "end": 12.48,
    "text": "that the lungs have one simple function and that's to bring air into and out of your lungs"
   },
   {
    "id": "t3",
    "start": 12.48,
    "end": 19.36,
    "text": "anything else is potentially harmful and i hear all the time marijuana must be safe because it's"
   },
   {
    "id": "t4",
    "start": 19.36,
    "end": 26.0,
    "text": "natural but here's the truth smoking marijuana regularly increases your risk of coronary disease"
   },
   {
    "id": "t5",
    "start": 26.0,
    "end": 32.96,
    "text": "and acute heart attack by 1.3 to two times those that don't smoke marijuana regularly."
   },
   {
    "id": "t6",
    "start": 32.96,
    "end": 38.8,
    "text": "That's the same increased risk as high blood pressure or increased cholesterol. Now I have"
   },
   {
    "id": "t7",
    "start": 38.8,
    "end": 44.72,
    "text": "operated on multiple patients over the years that smoke marijuana regularly and I can tell you that"
   },
   {
    "id": "t8",
    "start": 44.72,
    "end": 49.6,
    "text": "their lungs are totally black and it looks like they've worked in a coal mine and they've got such"
   },
   {
    "id": "t9",
    "start": 49.6,
    "end": 54.96,
    "text": "severe blockages that I have to do bypass surgery and these are folks that have never smoked a cigarette"
   },
   {
    "id": "t10",
    "start": 54.96,
    "end": 60.16,
    "text": "in their lives. And they all say the same thing. I thought it was safe. What's important"
   },
   {
    "id": "t11",
    "start": 60.16,
    "end": 62.72,
    "text": "to me is that you know the inherent risks."
   }
  ]
 },
